<title>USA: New Haven, Conn., GOs repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>New Haven, Conn., GOs repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc Tuesday said it repriced $28.885 million City of New Haven, Conn., general obligation refunding bonds, raising yields by five basis points each on the 2003 to 2009 maturities. A 2010 maturity was raised by 2.5 basis points. The top yield of 5.40 percent in 2011 was left unchanged.</p>
<p>CITY OF NEW HAVEN,CONNECTICUT</p>
<p>RE: $28,885,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION REFUNDING BONDS, 1996 SERIES</p>
<p>RECEIVED THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 12/01/1996</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 02/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 02/15 &amp; 08/15</p>
